This product includes third-party data in migrations/data/geo, built by
cmd/geosnapshot. Its manifest.json records the GeoNames dump date, the CLDR
version, the Wikidata query date and the SHA-256 of every source file.
Changes to all sources: filtered (all countries and first-level
subdivisions; cities above 500 inhabitants in Latin America and the
Caribbean, above 15000 elsewhere, plus national capitals), joined and
normalized into tables, one name per supported locale.

